### 다음 질문 받기 — 빈 답으로 시작
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/questions/next
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 기간을 고른 뒤
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/questions/next
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "months": "12"
}

### 기간 상관없음 — 전 기간을 통틀어 비교한다
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/questions/next
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "months": "any"
}

### 답이 쌓인 상태
POST http://localhost:8000/api/v1/questions/next
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "months": "12",
  "monthly": "300000",
  "salary_bank:0010001": "yes",
  "autopay": "yes"
}
